---@alias ApiVersion "1.0.0"

---Sent only to the mod itself right after its entry scripts ran (also after a hot reload).
---@class OnModLoadEvent
---@field reloaded boolean -- true when this is a hot reload

---Sent only to the mod itself before it is unloaded or hot-reloaded. Last chance to fill `mod.state` / `save`.
---@class OnModUnloadEvent
---@field reloading boolean -- true when followed by a reload

---A level (scene) finished loading.
---@class OnLevelLoadEvent
---@field level string -- scene name, e.g. 'M01/M01_main'

---The current level is being torn down.
---@class OnLevelUnloadEvent
---@field level string -- scene name

---Once per frame.
---@class OnUpdateEvent
---@field dt number -- seconds since last frame
---@field time number -- game time in seconds

---An entity is about to be created (cancel to prevent it). (cancelable)
---@class OnEntitySpawnEvent
---@field cancelled boolean? -- set to true to cancel
---@field entity? integer -- entity id (nil if not created yet)
---@field template string -- template / archetype name
---@field kind string -- entity kind
---@field name? string -- entity name
---@field position Vec3 -- spawn position

---An entity was removed.
---@class OnEntityDespawnEvent
---@field entity integer -- entity id

---An entity is about to take damage. `amount` may be modified; cancel to make it invulnerable to this hit. (cancelable)
---@class OnDamageEvent
---@field cancelled boolean? -- set to true to cancel
---@field victim integer -- entity taking damage
---@field attacker? integer -- entity dealing damage
---@field amount number -- damage (modifiable)
---@field weapon? string -- weapon / damage source name
---@field zone? string -- hit zone, e.g. 'head'

---An entity died.
---@class OnKillEvent
---@field victim integer -- entity that died
---@field killer? integer -- entity that killed it
---@field weapon? string -- weapon / cause
---@field accident? boolean -- true for staged accidents

---An entity is about to pick up an item. (cancelable)
---@class OnPickupEvent
---@field cancelled boolean? -- set to true to cancel
---@field entity integer -- the picker
---@field item string -- item / weapon name
---@field item_entity? integer -- world entity of the item

---An entity is about to perform a context action (open door, use item, ...). (cancelable)
---@class OnActionEvent
---@field cancelled boolean? -- set to true to cancel
---@field actor integer -- who acts
---@field action string -- action name
---@field target? integer -- target entity

---Mission logic raised an event (objective complete, target killed, alarm, ...).
---@class OnMissionEventEvent
---@field name string -- event name
---@field data? table -- event specific data

---A console variable changed.
---@class OnCvarChangedEvent
---@field name string -- cvar
---@field value any -- new value
---@field old any -- previous value

---Data patches were re-applied (hot reload). Re-read `data.get(..)`.
---@class OnDataReloadEvent

---The game is exiting.
---@class OnShutdownEvent

